# Charm Hyper's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-hyper-setting-api-key = 从 https://hyper.charm.land 获取的 Charm Hyper API 密钥。用于浏览器会话不可用或已过期时。
usage-hyper-setting-cookie = 登录 https://hyper.charm.land，打开开发者工具 > Application > Cookies > https://hyper.charm.land，将其中所有 Cookie 复制为一条 "name=value; name2=value2" 标头。

## The report: the Hypercredit balance, and the sign-in it was read with.

# The plan line: the balance was read with a hyper.charm.land browser
# session, or with an API key.
usage-hyper-browser-session = 浏览器会话
usage-hyper-api-key = API 密钥
# Charm Hyper's credits, shown as HC.
usage-hyper-hypercredits = Hypercredits
